  {
   "id": "fountains-203752@major-2026-09-10",
   "gameId": "fountains-203752",
   "displayName": "Major Update: introducing Gauntlet Mode!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-10T17:00:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Glad tidings, Adventurers! We're dropping a new major update today, ahead of next week's release of the Shattered Shape DLC and console versions - dig in and see what awaits you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quick reminder - The DLC Shattered Shape drops in a week!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Wishlist it here to be notified when it drops",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4922440/FOUNTAINS__Shattered_Shape/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🏆 Gauntlet Mode",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Each boss in the game is challenging on it's own, but could you handle beating them ALL - back to back, no breaks, no mercy? Gauntlet Mode is the ultimate boss-rush challenge, throwing every single boss at you one after another. Only the toughest will survive to the end. Do you have what it takes? 💀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41791865/6147ac421566776abad993a5c2f5ad38c2e1f9af.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🌍 New Languages",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "FOUNTAINS just got bigger! We've added German and Traditional Chinese to the game - jump into settings and switch it up right now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⏸️ Pause That Actually Pauses",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We heard you loud and clear. Until now, hitting Pause didn't stop in-game time - meaning you could step away and come back to find your character... very dead. 💀 Not anymore! Pause now truly freezes the action, enemies included. Go top-up that beverage in peace.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎚️ Difficulty Options",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Git gud is not always an option - new difficulty options allow you to tune the challenge to match your playstyle!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "✨ Quality of Life Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've also snuck in a bunch of smaller fixes and tweaks to make your run through FOUNTAINS smoother than ever.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's a huge week ahead for FOUNTAINS. Thank you for being part of this journey - now go show Gauntlet Mode who's boss. 😤",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
