  {
   "id": "fountains-203752@major-2026-07-22",
   "gameId": "fountains-203752",
   "displayName": "🏛️ A New Chapter Rises - Update & DLC Reveal!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-22T15:00:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Great news, Adventurers! FOUNTAINS is about to get bigger, sharper, and more accessible than ever. Grab your gear, because we've got a lot to unpack.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⚔️ Incoming Update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've been listening, and this update is all about giving you more control over your journey:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌍 New Language Options - explore the world of FOUNTAINS in more languages than ever before",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎚️ Difficulty Options - Git gud is not always an option - tune the challenge to match your playstyle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⏸️ Pause Option (finally!) - yes, you read that right. No more losing progress because real life called. The world will wait for you now, even in menus.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✨ Several more Quality of Life improvements - because the little things matter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🗺️ New DLC - \"Shattered Shape\" Announced!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The world of FOUNTAINS is expanding. We're thrilled to reveal a brand-new DLC featuring:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧭 A new fragment of the map to explore",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "👹 Brutal new bosses to test your resolve",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔮 New skills to master",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🗡️🛡️ New weapons and armor to add to your arsenal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "More details - including release date and pricing - coming soon. Stay tuned. Wishlists appreciated!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4922440/FOUNTAINS__Shattered_Shape/\"]🎮 FOUNTAINS Is Going Multiplatform!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Here's the big one: Crunching Koalas is bringing FOUNTAINS to PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and Nintendo Switch!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The souls-like adventure that started on PC is about to reach a whole new generation of players. Wishlist, follow, and get hyped - this is just the beginning.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for being part of this journey! We'd really appreciate you leaving any sort of reaction under this post - every little like and comment helps us <3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
